#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2260 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "All TRT rows carry a valid SRS preferred term of the dummy UNII dictionary (ASPIRIN, IBUPROFEN); the empty TSVAL on row 3 does not fire (completeness is another rule's concern) and the non-SRS value on the AGEMAX row is outside the TRT condition."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TRT    | ASPIRIN
S01 | TS | 2 | TRT    | IBUPROFEN
S01 | TS | 3 | TRT    |
S01 | TS | 4 | AGEMAX | P70Y
